{
 "title": "Device Register",
 "source": "Machine Master 20261110-01",
 "svg": "registry.svg",
 "notes": [
  [
   "Grid origin",
   "Intersection of the playfield left-right centerline and the line through both flipper pivots (carried from PMDD Table 3-1). Drawn as the red crosshair on the playfield layout."
  ],
  [
   "Grid axes",
   "X in mm, right of the centerline is positive. Y in mm, up the playfield from the flipper pivot line is positive. Flipper pivots read Y 0, X -73 and +73."
  ],
  [
   "Letter suffix",
   "By position, top to bottom, then left to right, except the banks below."
  ],
  [
   "DC-05 Drop target bank (side-by-side)",
   "A to G = position 1 to 7. Position 1 is the top circle in the playfield SVG; positions count left to right facing the target perpendicular to its ball-impact face (slant ignored)."
  ],
  [
   "DP-01 Standup targets (side-by-side)",
   "A to F = position 1 to 6, same orientation and pitch as DC-05; each standup is centered between two drop targets."
  ],
  [
   "DC-07 Drop target bank (inline)",
   "A = front (nearest the player) to D = furthest from the shooter end."
  ],
  [
   "DC-02 Slingshots leaf switches",
   "Suffix sw1 (upper) and sw2 (lower) on the slingshot instance; they carry no Register ID of their own."
  ],
  [
   "Lights DP-31 to DP-41",
   "Instance ID DP-3x-nn, nn numbered within the group top to bottom, then left to right (rows grouped in 8 mm bins). The addressable RGB LED chain index is a wiring attribute in the Electrical Master I/O map, not part of the instance ID. The playfield layout shows light tags shortened (38-03 = DP-38-03)."
  ],
  [
   "DP-27 to DP-30 (Internal Electronics)",
   "One CAD symbol holds all six instances; coordinates are nominal, spaced inside the symbol, not measured."
  ],
  [
   "Cabinet items",
   "Cabinet grid with the same X/Y origin and a Z axis below the playfield; defined at T6."
  ],
  [
   "Retired IDs",
   "DP-02, DP-05, DP-07, DP-08 (never reused). DP-06, DP-14, DP-15 deleted (merged). DP-10 Flipper coil/driver removed from the Register: each DC-04 Flipper assembly includes its coil (proposed; Scott to confirm)."
  ],
  [
   "Light quantities",
   "Counted from the playfield SVG by the 11 light groups (DP-31 to DP-41, decided 2026-11-09): 68 recessed + 3 stars (DP-40, one in each pop bumper) + 32 post = 103 lights in the CAD today. CAD controls counts; update Qty if the CAD changes."
  ],
  [
   "Electrical?",
   "Y = has an electrical interface to a Topedal board, supply or host. N = mechanical only. TBD = undecided. Proposed; not yet reviewed by Scott."
  ],
  [
   "Instance IDs",
   "Tag on the playfield layout: device ID plus suffix (letters for most devices, numbers within the group for lights). Devices with no symbol on the playfield have none. DP-27 to DP-30 share one CAD symbol (Internal Electronics), so their tags are placed inside it."
  ],
  [
   "Detail document",
   "Stems of the controlling pmdd_<family> documents until the device cards replace them."
  ],
  [
   "Source / revision",
   "Moved from Machine Master 20261110-01 (Register, Instance table, Device Registry graphic). Built from playfield CAD export pf-playfield-20261009. CAD controls geometry and counts. Not tagged on the layout: DB-02, MC-01 to MC-05, MD-01, MG-01, MG-02. Flippers DC-04A to DC-04C are tagged at the pivot circles. ML-01 position assumed until the fuller CAD arrives."
  ]
 ],
